  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fortalecimiento del Programa de Desarrollo Humano Oportunidades III</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of the Oportunidades Human Development Program III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El propsito de esta operacin es contribuir a la consolidacin de los ajustes al modelo urbano de operacin del Programa de Desarrollo Humano Oportunidades. Para ello, esta operacin le permitir al Banco mantener su colaboracin tcnica con el pas y supervisar la consecucin de hitos clave para la consolidacin del modelo urbano.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this operation is to help reinforce the adjustments to the urban operating model for Oportunidades. To that end, this operation will allow the Bank to continue its technical collaboration with Mexico and to supervise the attainment of key milestones for strengthening of the urban model.</narrative>
  </description>
